 يجمع المركبة الرأسية بدلاً من طرحها.","En":"(9,−1) adds the vertical component rather than subtracting it."}}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا كان u=(4,-2) وv=(-1,3)، فما مركبتا المتجه 2u-v؟","En":"For u=(4,-2) and v=(-1,3), what are the components of 2u−v?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نضرب كل مركبة بالمعامل ثم نطرح المركبات المتناظرة.","En":"Scale each component, then subtract corresponding components."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب كل مركبة من u في 2 فنحصل على (8,−4).","En":"Scale each component of u by two to obtain (8,−4)."},{"Ar":"$2u=(8,-4),\\quad(8-(-1),-4-3)$","En":"$2u=(8,-4),\\quad(8-(-1),-4-3)$"},{"Ar":"نطرح مركبتي v مع الحفاظ على الإشارات؛ طرح −1 يعطي +1.","En":"Subtract corresponding components of v, preserving signs; subtracting −1 adds one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(9,-7)$","En":"$(9,-7)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"وزع المعامل على المركبتين قبل الطرح.","En":"Scale both components before subtracting."},"FormulaLatex":"2u-v=(2u_x-v_x,2u_y-v_y)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(9,-7)$","En":"$(9,-7)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(9,-7)+(-1,3)=(8,-4)$","En":"$(9,-7)+(-1,3)=(8,-4)$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":87,"PrimarySkillId":340,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بضرب المتجه u في اثنين.","En":"Start by scaling vector u by two."},{"Ar":"اطرح المتجه الثاني مركبةً مركبةً من الناتج.","En":"Subtract the second vector component by component."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نضرب كل مركبة بالمعامل ثم نطرح المركبات المتناظرة.","En":"Scale each component, then subtract corresponding components."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب كل مركبة من u في 2 فنحصل على (8,−4).","En":"Scale each component of u by two to obtain (8,−4)."},{"Ar":"$2u=(8,-4),\\quad(8-(-1),-4-3)$","En":"$2u=(8,-4),\\quad(8-(-1),-4-3)$"},{"Ar":"نطرح مركبتي v مع الحفاظ على الإشارات؛ طرح −1 يعطي +1.","En":"Subtract corresponding components of v, preserving signs; subtracting −1 adds one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(9,-7)$","En":"$(9,-7)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"وزع المعامل على المركبتين قبل الطرح.","En":"Scale both components before subtracting."},"FormulaLatex":"2u-v=(2u_x-v_x,2u_y-v_y)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(9,-7)$","En":"$(9,-7)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(9,-7)+(-1,3)=(8,-4)$","En":"$(9,-7)+(-1,3)=(8,-4)$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(7,−1) يضيف v بدلاً من طرحه.","En":"(7,−1) adds v rather than subtracting it."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(8,−6) لا يطرح مركبتي v بالشكل الصحيح.","En":"(8,−6) does not correctly subtract both components of v."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(9,−1) يجمع المركبة الرأسية بدلاً من طرحها.","En":"(9,−1) adds the vertical component rather than subtracting it."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نضرب كل مركبة بالمعامل ثم نطرح المركبات المتناظرة.

$2u-v=(2u_x-v_x,2u_y-v_y)$

1. نضرب كل مركبة من u في 2 فنحصل على (8,−4).

2. $2u=(8,-4),\quad(8-(-1),-4-3)$

3. نطرح مركبتي v مع الحفاظ على الإشارات؛ طرح −1 يعطي +1.

$(9,-7)$

$(9,-7)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(9,-7)+(-1,3)=(8,-4)$

وزع المعامل على المركبتين قبل الطرح.$mw$,$mw$Scale each component, then subtract corresponding components.

$2u-v=(2u_x-v_x,2u_y-v_y)$

1. Scale each component of u by two to obtain (8,−4).

2. $2u=(8,-4),\quad(8-(-1),-4-3)$

3. Subtract corresponding components of v, preserving signs; subtracting −1 adds one.

$(9,-7)$

$(9,-7)$ Dimensionless

$(9,-7)+(-1,3)=(8,-4)$

Scale both components before subtracting.$mw$),
