"Ar":"(3,4) طوله خمسة لا واحد.","En":"(3,4) has length five, not one."}},{"LatexCode":"(\\frac{3}{4},1)","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(3/4,1) طوله 5/4 لا واحد.","En":"(3/4,1) has length 5/4, not one."}}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما متجه الوحدة في اتجاه المتجه (3,4) باستعمال المعيار الإقليدي؟","En":"What is the unit vector in the direction of (3,4) under the Euclidean norm?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"متجه الوحدة في الاتجاه نفسه ينتج بقسمة المتجه على معياره.","En":"The unit vector in the same direction is the vector divided by its norm."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحسب طول المتجه؛ وهو خمسة، فلا توجد قسمة على صفر.","En":"Find the vector length, five, so division by zero is avoided."},{"Ar":"$\\|v\\|_2=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5$","En":"$\\|v\\|_2=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5$"},{"Ar":"نقسم المركبتين على الطول الموجب نفسه، فيبقى الاتجاه ويصبح الطول واحداً.","En":"Divide both components by the same positive length, preserving direction and making the length one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(\\frac{3}{5},\\frac{4}{5})$","En":"$(\\frac{3}{5},\\frac{4}{5})$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسم كل مركبة على قيمة مختلفة.","En":"Do not divide components by different values."},"FormulaLatex":"\\hat v=v/\\|v\\|_2,\\quad v\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\hat v=(3/5,4/5)$","En":"$\\hat v=(3/5,4/5)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2}=1$","En":"$\\sqrt{(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2}=1$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":87,"PrimarySkillId":339,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب طول المتجه أولاً.","En":"Calculate the vector length first."},{"Ar":"اقسم كل مركبة على الطول نفسه.","En":"Divide both components by the same length."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"متجه الوحدة في الاتجاه نفسه ينتج بقسمة المتجه على معياره.","En":"The unit vector in the same direction is the vector divided by its norm."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحسب طول المتجه؛ وهو خمسة، فلا توجد قسمة على صفر.","En":"Find the vector length, five, so division by zero is avoided."},{"Ar":"$\\|v\\|_2=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5$","En":"$\\|v\\|_2=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5$"},{"Ar":"نقسم المركبتين على الطول الموجب نفسه، فيبقى الاتجاه ويصبح الطول واحداً.","En":"Divide both components by the same positive length, preserving direction and making the length one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(\\frac{3}{5},\\frac{4}{5})$","En":"$(\\frac{3}{5},\\frac{4}{5})$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسم كل مركبة على قيمة مختلفة.","En":"Do not divide components by different values."},"FormulaLatex":"\\hat v=v/\\|v\\|_2,\\quad v\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\hat v=(3/5,4/5)$","En":"$\\hat v=(3/5,4/5)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2}=1$","En":"$\\sqrt{(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2}=1$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(4/5,3/5) متجه وحدة لكنه يبدل الاتجاه.","En":"(4/5,3/5) is a unit vector but changes the direction."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(3,4) طوله خمسة لا واحد.","En":"(3,4) has length five, not one."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"(3/4,1) طوله 5/4 لا واحد.","En":"(3/4,1) has length 5/4, not one."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$متجه الوحدة في الاتجاه نفسه ينتج بقسمة المتجه على معياره.

$\hat v=v/\|v\|_2,\quad v\ne0$

1. نحسب طول المتجه؛ وهو خمسة، فلا توجد قسمة على صفر.

2. $\|v\|_2=\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5$

3. نقسم المركبتين على الطول الموجب نفسه، فيبقى الاتجاه ويصبح الطول واحداً.

$\hat v=(3/5,4/5)$

$(\frac{3}{5},\frac{4}{5})$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\sqrt{(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2}=1$

لا تقسم كل مركبة على قيمة مختلفة.$mw$,$mw$The unit vector in the same direction is the vector divided by its norm.

$\hat v=v/\|v\|_2,\quad v\ne0$

1. Find the vector length, five, so division by zero is avoided.

2. $\|v\|_2=\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5$

3. Divide both components by the same positive length, preserving direction and making the length one.

$\hat v=(3/5,4/5)$

$(\frac{3}{5},\frac{4}{5})$ Dimensionless

$\sqrt{(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2}=1$

Do not divide components by different values.$mw$),
(932,1693,$mw$23076719BCA180C58F558BE2E4B5C790F30B8A95CB78FAAF5BB315FB58082482$mw$,$mw$c832c2a93c062e68fbf90e02460adedb$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1693,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":87,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"كم قياس الزاوية الأصغر بين المتجهين (1,0) و(1,1) بوحدة الراديان؟","TitleEn":"What is the smaller angle, in radians, between the vectors (1,0) and (1,1)?","QuestionTextAr":"كم قياس الزاوية الأصغر بين المتجهين (1,0) و(1,1) بوحدة الراديان؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the smaller angle, in radians, between the vectors (1,0) and (1,1)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: قانون زاوية المتجهات: cosθ = (a·b)/(|a||b|).\n\nخطوات الحل: الضرب القياسي يساوي 1، والمقداران 1 و√2؛ إذن جيب تمام الزاوية 1/√2 وتساوي π/4.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Angle formula: cosθ = (a·b)/(|a||b|).\n\nSolution steps: The dot product is 1 and norms are 1 and √2, so cos θ=1/√2 and θ=π/4.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6761,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6762,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\pi}{4}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6763,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\pi}{3}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6764,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\pi}{2}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب الضرب القياسي ومعياري المتجهين.","En":"Find the dot product and both vector norms."},{"Ar":"كوّن نسبة جيب التمام ثم استخرج الزاوية بين صفر وباي.","En":"Form the cosine ratio, then find the angle between zero and pi."}],"Title":{"Ar":"كم قياس الزاوية الأصغر بين المتجهين (1,0) و(1,1) بوحدة الراديان؟","En":"What is the smaller angle, in radians, between the vectors (1,0) and (1,1)?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جيب تمام π/6 يساوي جذر 3 على 2.","En":"The cosine of pi/6 is square root of three over two."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\pi}{4}","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\pi}{3}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جيب تمام π/3 يساوي نصفاً.","En":"The cosine of pi/3 is one half."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\pi}{2}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جيب تمام π/2 يساوي صفراً، والمتجهان ليسا متعامدين.","En":"The cosine of pi/2 is zero, and the vectors are not perpendicular."}}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"كم قياس الزاوية الأصغر بين المتجهين (1,0) و(1,1) بوحدة الراديان؟","En":"What is the smaller angle, in radians, between the vectors (1,0) and (1,1)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب القياسي يحدد جيب تمام الزاوية بين متجهين غير صفريين.","En":"The dot product determines the cosine of the angle between nonzero vectors."},"Unit":{"Ar":"راديان","En":"Radians"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المتجهان غير صفريين، فنحسب الضرب القياسي والطولين.","En":"Both vectors are nonzero; compute their dot product and lengths."},{"Ar":"$u\\cdot v=1,\\quad\\|u\\|_2=1,\\quad\\|v\\|_2=\\sqrt2$","En":"$u\\cdot v=1,\\quad\\|u\\|_2=1,\\quad\\|v\\|_2=\\sqrt2$"},{"Ar":"نجد جيب تمام الزاوية 1/جذر 2، ونختار الزاوية في الفترة من صفر إلى π بالراديان.","En":"The cosine is one over square root of two; choose the angle in zero to pi radians."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$","En":"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الزاوية بالراديان مع الدرجة أو قيمة جيب تمامها.","En":"Do not confuse radians with degrees or the cosine value."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{u\\cdot v}{\\|u\\|_2\\|v\\|_2},\\quad0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\theta=\\arccos(1/\\sqrt2)=\\pi/4$","En":"$\\theta=\\arccos(1/\\sqrt2)=\\pi/4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\cos(\\pi/4)=\\sqrt2/2$","En":"$\\cos(\\pi/4)=\\sqrt2/2$"}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":87,"PrimarySkillId":338,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب الضرب القياسي ومعياري المتجهين.","En":"Find the dot product and both vector norms."},{"Ar":"كوّن نسبة جيب التمام ثم استخرج الزاوية بين صفر وباي.","En":"Form the cosine ratio, then find the angle between zero and pi."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب القياسي يحدد جيب تمام الزاوية بين متجهين غير صفريين.","En":"The dot product determines the cosine of the angle between nonzero vectors."},"Unit":{"Ar":"راديان","En":"Radians"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المتجهان غير صفريين، فنحسب الضرب القياسي والطولين.","En":"Both vectors are nonzero; compute their dot product and lengths."},{"Ar":"$u\\cdot v=1,\\quad\\|u\\|_2=1,\\quad\\|v\\|_2=\\sqrt2$","En":"$u\\cdot v=1,\\quad\\|u\\|_2=1,\\quad\\|v\\|_2=\\sqrt2$"},{"Ar":"نجد جيب تمام الزاوية 1/جذر 2، ونختار الزاوية في الفترة من صفر إلى π بالراديان.","En":"The cosine is one over square root of two; choose the angle in zero to pi radians."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$","En":"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الزاوية بالراديان مع الدرجة أو قيمة جيب تمامها.","En":"Do not confuse radians with degrees or the cosine value."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{u\\cdot v}{\\|u\\|_2\\|v\\|_2},\\quad0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\theta=\\arccos(1/\\sqrt2)=\\pi/4$","En":"$\\theta=\\arccos(1/\\sqrt2)=\\pi/4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\cos(\\pi/4)=\\sqrt2/2$","En":"$\\cos(\\pi/4)=\\sqrt2/2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جيب تمام π/6 يساوي جذر 3 على 2.","En":"The cosine of pi/6 is square root of three over two."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جيب تمام π/3 يساوي نصفاً.","En":"The cosine of pi/3 is one half."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جيب تمام π/2 يساوي صفراً، والمتجهان ليسا متعامدين.","En":"The cosine of pi/2 is zero, and the vectors are not perpendicular."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الضرب القياسي يحدد جيب تمام الزاوية بين متجهين غير صفريين.

$\cos\theta=\frac{u\cdot v}{\|u\|_2\|v\|_2},\quad0\le\theta\le\pi$

1. المتجهان غير صفريين، فنحسب الضرب القياسي والطولين.

2. $u\cdot v=1,\quad\|u\|_2=1,\quad\|v\|_2=\sqrt2$

3. نجد جيب تمام الزاوية 1/جذر 2، ونختار الزاوية في الفترة من صفر إلى π بالراديان.

$\theta=\arccos(1/\sqrt2)=\pi/4$

$\frac{\pi}{4}$ راديان

$\cos(\pi/4)=\sqrt2/2$

لا تخلط الزاوية بالراديان مع الدرجة أو قيمة جيب تمامها.$mw$,$mw$The dot product determines the cosine of the angle between nonzero vectors.

$\cos\theta=\frac{u\cdot v}{\|u\|_2\|v\|_2},\quad0\le\theta\le\pi$

1. Both vectors are nonzero; compute their dot product and lengths.

2. $u\cdot v=1,\quad\|u\|_2=1,\quad\|v\|_2=\sqrt2$

3. The cosine is one over square root of two; choose the angle in zero to pi radians.

$\theta=\arccos(1/\sqrt2)=\pi/4$

$\frac{\pi}{4}$ Radians

$\cos(\pi/4)=\sqrt2/2$

Do not confuse radians with degrees or the cosine value.$mw$);
DO $audit$
DECLARE b record; d "CurriculumDraftItems"%ROWTYPE; p "Problems"%ROWTYPE; tr int; sk int; n int; actor int;
BEGIN
 FOR b IN SELECT * FROM reviewed_batch ORDER BY source LOOP
  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(-b.source::bigint);
  SELECT * INTO STRICT d FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "Id"=b.draft FOR UPDATE;
  SELECT * INTO STRICT p FROM "Problems" WHERE "Id"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "QuestionOptions" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  actor:=d."OwnerUserId"; tr:=(b.wizard->'TrackIds'->>0)::int; sk:=(b.wizard->>'PrimarySkillId')::int;
  IF d."SourceProblemId" IS DISTINCT FROM b.source OR d."Revision"<>0 OR d."EditorialStatus"<>'Draft' OR d."PublishedProblemId" IS NOT NULL OR d."SourceFingerprint" IS DISTINCT FROM b.fp OR md5(d."WizardJson") IS DISTINCT FROM b.draft_hash OR upper(encode(sha256(decode(b.source_hex,'hex')),'hex'))<>b.fp OR (SELECT json_build_object('Id',pp."Id",'StageId',pp."StageId",'CategoryId',pp."CategoryId",'Points',pp."Points",'TitleAr',pp."TitleAr",'TitleEn',pp."TitleEn",'QuestionTextAr',pp."QuestionTextAr",'QuestionTextEn',pp."QuestionTextEn",'DetailedSolutionAr',pp."DetailedSolutionAr",'DetailedSolutionEn',pp."DetailedSolutionEn",'YoutubeSolutionUrl',pp."YoutubeSolutionUrl",'EditorialDetailsJson',pp."EditorialDetailsJson",'Options',(select json_agg(json_build_object('Id',o."Id",'Order',o."Order",'LatexCode',o."LatexCode",'IsCorrect',o."IsCorrect") order by o."Order",o."Id") from "QuestionOptions" o where o."ProblemId"=pp."Id"))::jsonb FROM "Problems" pp WHERE pp."Id"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM b.snapshot THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Source/draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Users" WHERE "Id"=actor AND "Role"='Admin' AND "IsActive" AND NOT "StaffSetupPending") OR (SELECT count(*) FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "SourceProblemId"=b.source AND "EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn'))<>1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Owner/open-draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int) ORDER BY "Id" FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id"=tr AND "StageId"=p."StageId" AND "IsPublished" AND "Revision"<2147483647) OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Categories" WHERE "Id"=p."CategoryId" AND "StageId"=p."StageId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumSkills" s JOIN "CurriculumDomains" dm ON dm."Id"=s."DomainId" WHERE s."Id"=sk AND s."StageId"=p."StageId" AND s."CategoryId"=p."CategoryId" AND s."IsPublished" AND dm."IsPublished") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "SkillId"=sk) OR (SELECT array_agg("TrackId" ORDER BY "TrackId") FROM "LearningTrackProblems" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int ORDER BY 1) OR (SELECT array_agg("SkillId" ORDER BY "SkillId") FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY[sk] OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source AND "SkillId"=sk AND "IsPrimary") OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds') j(id) LEFT JOIN "LearningTracks" lt ON lt."Id"=j.id::int WHERE lt."Id" IS NULL OR lt."StageId"<>p."StageId" OR lt."Revision">=2147483647 OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "SkillId"=sk)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Scope conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Problems" q WHERE q."Id"<>b.source AND q."StageId"=p."StageId" AND (upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')) OR upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')))) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" x WHERE x."Id"<>b.draft AND x."EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn') AND (x."WizardJson"::jsonb#>>'{Question,Ar}'=p."QuestionTextAr" OR x."WizardJson"::jsonb#>>'{Question,En}'=p."QuestionTextEn")) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Open draft duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF b.wizard#>>'{Question,Ar}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextAr" OR b.wizard#>>'{Question,En}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextEn" OR length(b.flat_ar)>12000 OR length(b.flat_en)>12000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question/length conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  UPDATE "Problems" SET "TitleAr"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,Ar}',"TitleEn"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,En}',"DetailedSolutionAr"=b.flat_ar,"DetailedSolutionEn"=b.flat_en,"EditorialDetailsJson"=b.metadata WHERE "Id"=b.source;
  UPDATE "CurriculumDraftItems" SET "WizardJson"=b.wizard::text,"EditorialStatus"='Published',"Revision"=4,"SubmittedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedByUserId"=actor,"ReviewNote"='Owner-authorized SQL maintenance; AI educational review and source-locked verification. Existing draft owner recorded for attribution; no API login.',"PublishedAtUtc"=now(),"PublishedProblemId"=b.source WHERE "Id"=b.draft;
  UPDATE "LearningTracks" SET "Revision"="Revision"+1 WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int);
  INSERT INTO "PlatformActivityEvents"("ActorUserId","ActorRole","Action","Resource","ResourceId","Origin","CreatedAtUtc") SELECT actor,'Admin',action,'EditorialProblem',b.draft::text,'owner_sql',now() FROM unnest(ARRAY['EditorialDraftEdited','EditorialDraftSubmitted','EditorialDraftApproved','EditorialAmendmentPublished']) action;
 END LOOP;
END $audit$;
COMMIT;
